# Heartbeat runtime is never tracked; the machinery + docs + templates are (by design).
state/*
!state/start.md
sandbox/
designs/.$*.bkp
# scratch: the apex re-includes !/.hb-heartbeat/** wholesale, so without this tmp/ is
# neither tracked nor ignored and sits in `git status` forever, inflating the
# statusline's uncommitted counter and adding noise to every `git add -A` review.
tmp/
